    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Land of Silence is a Survival Zombie post-apocalyptic semi open world set after a devastating global pandemic set in Ashvale county in Ireland. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to find a reason to live in a land surrounded by death and enemies everywhere. Scavenge through abandoned places for equipment, items or resources. Find other survivors to help them, trade with them or steal from them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Current Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Manage scarce resources such as food, drink and ammunition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Third Person combat and stealth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Zombies with in-depth visual and hearing systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Deal with limited inventory space, hunger, thirst and illness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Xbox Controller Gamepad support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm a solo developer aiming to create a survival horror game like those from the '90s, but with modern controls and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to help or support me in making this game a reality, you can subscribe to my YouTube channel. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you all for your support, you keep Daniel Pintado Game Development alive!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Land of Silence is a Survival Zombie post-apocalyptic semi open world set after a devastating global pandemic set in Ashvale county in Ireland. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to find a reason to live in a land surrounded by death and enemies everywhere. Scavenge through abandoned places for equipment, items or resources. Find other survivors to help them, trade with them or steal from them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Current Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Manage scarce resources such as food, drink and ammunition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Third Person combat and stealth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Zombies with in-depth visual and hearing systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Deal with limited inventory space, hunger, thirst and illness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Xbox Controller Gamepad support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm a solo developer aiming to create a survival horror game like those from the '90s, but with modern controls and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to help or support me in making this game a reality, you can subscribe to my YouTube channel. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you all for your support, you keep Daniel Pintado Game Development alive!</p>",
    "short_description": "Land of Silence is a Survival Zombie post-apocalyptic semi open set in Ashvale county in Ireland. Bringing back old school survival horror with modern touches. Managing scarce resources such as food, drink and ammunition.",
